# Original photographs supplied by the practice owner. Kept locally for future
# re-crops, deliberately NOT committed: this repo is public, and the originals
# include full-resolution personal photographs of the doctor and his wife that
# were never intended for publication. Only the derived portrait actually used
# on the site (public/images/dr-sheng-chang.jpg) is committed.
src-photos/

# Source photos for recognition and gallery albums. Contains 3 Arcadia Public
# Library archive photos that must never be reproduced or committed. Only the
# derived and resized images (public/images/recognition/*.jpg and
# public/images/gallery/{thumb,full}/*.jpg) are committed.
_Sheng Chang Photos/

# Astro generates this directory on every dev run and build. It was
# committed by mistake: data-store.json is a content-layer cache that changes
# on every build, so it dirtied the working tree constantly and appeared in ten
# commits as noise. Everything here is regenerated by `astro sync`, which runs
# as part of dev and build.
.astro/

# Playwright MCP scratch output (screenshots, snapshots, console logs)
.playwright-mcp/
